Hi, I'm Devanshi Vashist 👋
Aerospace Engineer | Aerospace Research & Engineering Simulation
I am an Aerospace Engineer with a strong interest in computational aerospace engineering, aerodynamic analysis, aircraft design, structural mechanics, and engineering simulation. I enjoy exploring engineering challenges and applying analytical, numerical, and simulation-based methods to aerospace problems.

I have completed a Project Internship at IIT Delhi, gaining valuable exposure to engineering research, technical problem-solving, and practical applications of aerospace engineering.
